{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a29f41c207134709c75c04f197485381dcf5563764e473cb95629d19f524e6df", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影中。\nシルクのパジャマを着た春香は雰囲気が違うな！）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄中。穿着真丝睡衣的春香，给人的感觉真不一样啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "1e23c30785b1da970f112135ea0ab4295b97d09df5ee825b773a344cd63ba80a", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん。\n……なんか、いつもより緊張しちゃいました。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n……总觉得比平时更紧张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e7be62cb64b7253d82e4a7a6255873be99b7886065ec0facb856305b6a410165", "ja": "そうなのか？\nそんな風には見えなかったけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n不过看起来倒不像紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "9bb8671ac120a555251517093d8f1f6cc586b8aa6b02588c88a1852f1d3fb6df", "ja": "だってシルクですよ、シルク！\n万が一転んじゃったりしたらと思って……！", "zh": "毕竟是丝绸啊，丝绸！我是担心万一摔倒了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "3ee73c1c3f564f95702ac29c4d0aadbc94b043c4d456dd5d66d802588ba93979", "ja": "それに、いつも着てるものとは全然違うから、\nいつもと同じじゃダメかなって思って……", "zh": "而且，这和我平时穿的衣服完全不一样，所以我在想，不能像平时那样对待吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1005_p", "source_sha256": "77089757604093139e482370f132d04d799c2951e4b9dfa393c7c6c3807c21a0", "ja": "なるほどな。でも、そんなにかしこまることはないと\n思うよ。転んでもそう破れたりはしないだろうし。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，也不用这么拘谨吧。就算摔倒了，应该也不会那么容易破。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "699e3bcdaacd31f0000335b95603db9dcaa32f62e2f794cf75d0f9601f1bde96", "ja": "こういうパジャマに合った\nポーズがあるんじゃないかと思って調べてきたんです！", "zh": "我觉得应该有适合这种睡衣的姿势，所以特意查了一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7120301b6979c67d7a29f318a361db12bd46fddc34e4b8967f79eb36ea63f014", "ja": "シルクのパジャマに合ったポーズ……？", "zh": "适合丝绸睡衣的姿势……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "a4b68b8a84ec9f680f7f54861dd98a5cef348a47ad6dd0f97c0e013b866b31eb", "ja": "はい。おしとやかで、上品な感じで、\nこう、ゆったりしてて……！", "zh": "是的。要显得文静、优雅，\n像这样，动作舒缓一些……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2cae5fb6684674024c023018cb8c5ecd527ead170a63924e0b22e9df881a4d33", "ja": "なるほど……\n言われてみれば……。", "zh": "原来如此……\n仔细想想，还真是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "4dc6e33ef91d9112db292753c2152526bf7e7dc0e82fa8f69e82dff2ff04a4ea", "ja": "言われてみればって……\nもう、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "你说“这么一想”……真是的，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "b646b0e45b0a6c6cd84ec2e86db6dab3ea2e2b1261ab4b9b9b09210f286fee0e", "ja": "私、さっきの撮影もその辺りを意識して\n……あ、あれっ！？", "zh": "我刚才拍摄的时候也有意识到那方面……\n……啊，等、等等！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "b51419eb56ab189e0b40e2a0bc8fc4630b56316075d2930a9e0e76667471864a", "ja": "ど、どうしましょう！　私、緊張し過ぎて途中から\nその演技プラン、すっかり忘れちゃってました……！", "zh": "怎、怎么办！我太紧张了，从中途开始就把那个演技方案忘得一干二净了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "02aa7b36e8e44ec93eba0498b355b81906d47906f5834eda55e452427596dc82", "ja": "で、でも大丈夫です！\nこの後の撮影で、しっかり活かしますから！", "zh": "但、但是没关系！  \n我会在接下来的拍摄中好好发挥的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1014_p", "source_sha256": "73533935d183909a06501dfa7d32a05cfe3db6006f965c23b1fb57ada9026de6", "ja": "いや、今のままでいいと思う！\nスタッフさんたちも好感触だったしな。", "zh": "不，我觉得保持现在这样就挺好的！\n工作人员们的反响也很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "466bc29dc9950efb6d6bf7651e424cdb752e64f6f572b6635099b60e08503216", "ja": "ええっ！？　ホントですか！？", "zh": "诶！？真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b8eeb67a9167a455c1baa222aa0eb0ada5d5b9cf86718330e5fa425607dfab1c", "ja": "ああ。俺も今の春香が一番いいと思うよ。", "zh": "对。我也觉得现在这样的春香最好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0453_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "96d009979dea9f6e106f0d9316d4bf522d268a9302be226757063112be5d9437", "ja": "！　わかりました。\nこの後の撮影も、私らしく頑張りますね。えへへ♪", "zh": "！明白了。接下来的拍摄，我也会以自己的风格努力的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
